# Why: the station page is replaced by the console; an open stale page pushes its own crew roster and answers agent calls.
# With STARNET_HEADLESS=1 serveStatic answers 410 for every non-API path; all /api routes are unchanged.
# Apply: git -C starnet apply --3way ../company/patches/0010-headless-station.diff   Revert: same with -R
